          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "50% OFF SELECT MODELS",
            "text": "<p>When we use the term 'built for the course, designed for life' to describe our shoes, it's not some throw-away line. TRUE linkswear ambassador Chris Kirk proved that, winning The Sentry (the opening PGA Tour event of the year) in Hawaii wearing arguably our most versatile model, the All Day Ripstop V2.<br\/><br\/>Get your pair of the All Day Ripstop V2, All Day Ripstop, LUX Pro, and\/or All Day Chino for <strong>50% off <\/strong>while supplies last using code CONGRATSCHRIS at checkout. Valid through Tuesday, January 9th at 11:59PM PST.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        },
